{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 29,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that being often reproved hardeneth his neck\nShall suddenly be destroyed, and that without remedy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the righteous are increased, the people rejoice;\nBut when a wicked man beareth rule, the people sigh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso loveth wisdom rejoiceth his father;\nBut he that keepeth company with harlots wasteth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " substance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king by justice establisheth the land;\nBut he that exacteth gifts overthroweth it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man that flattereth his neighbor\nSpreadeth a net for his steps.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the transgression of an evil man there is a snare;\nBut the righteous doth sing and rejoice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous taketh knowledge of the cause of the poor;\nThe wicked hath not understanding to know ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Scoffers set a city in a flame;\nBut wise men turn away wrath.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If a wise man hath a controversy with a foolish man,Whether he be angry or laugh, there will be no rest.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The bloodthirsty hate him that is perfect;And as for the upright, they seek his life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A fool uttereth all his anger;\nBut a wise man keepeth it back and stilleth it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If a ruler hearkeneth to falsehood,\nAll his servants are wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The poor man and the oppressor meet together;\nJehovah lighteneth the eyes of them both.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king that faithfully judgeth the poor,\nHis throne shall be established for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rod and reproof give wisdom;\nBut a child left to himself causeth shame to his mother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the wicked are increased, transgression increaseth;\nBut the righteous shall look upon their fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Correct thy son, and he will give thee rest;\nYea, he will give delight unto thy soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where there is no vision, the people cast off restraint;\nBut he that keepeth the law, happy is he.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A servant will not be corrected by words;\nFor though he understand, he will not give heed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seest thou a man that is hasty in his words?\nThere is more hope of a fool than of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that delicately bringeth up his servant from a child\nShall have him become a son at the last.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "An angry man stirreth up strife,\nAnd a wrathful man aboundeth in transgression.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man’s pride shall bring him low;\nBut he that is of a lowly spirit shall obtain honor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso is partner with a thief hateth his own soul;\nHe heareth the adjuration and uttereth nothing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of man bringeth a snare;\nBut whoso putteth his trust in Jehovah shall be safe.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many seek the ruler’s favor;\nBut a man’s judgment ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.29.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.29.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "An unjust man is an abomination to the righteous;\nAnd he that is upright in the way is an abomination to the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
